prognostic markers in pancreatic cancer</article-title><source>J Hepatobiliary Pancreat Surg</source><year>2002</year><volume>9</volume><supplement>1</supplement><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>11</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Hepatobiliary Pancreat Surg||9|1||bib7|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12021893</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Goggins</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kern</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Offerhaus</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Hruban</surname><given-names>RH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Progress in cancer genetics: lessons from pancreatic cancer</article-title><source>Ann Oncol</source><year>1999</year><volume>10</volume><supplement>Suppl 4</supplement><fpage>4</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ann Oncol||10|4||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10436774</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hermanek</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pathology and biology of pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma</article-title><source>Langenbecks Arch Surg</source><year>1998</year><volume>383</volume><supplement>2</supplement><fpage>116</fpage><lpage>120</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Langenbecks Arch Surg||383|116||bib9|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9641883</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hilgers</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Kern</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Molecular genetic basis of pancreatic adenocarcinoma</article-title><source>Genes Chromosomes Cancer</source><year>1999</year><volume>26</volume><supplement>1</supplement><fpage>1</fpage